          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata sheeh damaniyeenya gwaneayeewa uhuuda gheeda haw mida Babeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gwayi sugoocheanda, “Nih mii Babeleeda hawi ghayi aadeaschi aba uurdeanyu haw ghoah gheeda sugoocheanda bea giibinda bea gheambalmeedeanyu hawi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda duu gwarina ng'asheesu ghuuta sugoocheanda, gwashuubean ghuuta leabu humng'eeda, “Ea sugoocheanda was Nebukadinesa, aleeysiina iit ng'asheega eargu: Sugoocheanduumeeda sigeandeawa headaang'u, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gajeahoananeey jeeda buuneeda, ak giibindaang'u gaymideaydooscheewana diyeanga jarooda; ak gajeanung' aga nyeega uurjeewana deeda; ak gayghang'ata gweanyeew ispwa aba headaang'u, ak gaynala gideaba ASEETA Haw bea humng'eeda goombal sugoodiga buuneeda ak iissa ghoadaw siida gasa sugoocheanduumeeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mii ghoah gil gwasa ng'asheanda, sirukusa Nebukadinesa. Ak geahoana jeeda buuneeda, ak ghwaakta nyeega deeda, ak ghwashabwa saseadaanyi aba rahooda humng'eeda ea gageawiitiida buudeagaaschi dabiniga rabearda, nea budilgaaschi gooyang'achiida budilga madooyda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
