        {
          "text": "Muchu nea ning'ata gweanyeew ispwa geagatkachi gheanyangeasu aniineeda was Nebukadinesa dea geal humng'eeda, ak gabiigu fughareedeanyu, ak geabadiischeesi ASEETA Haw bea humng'eeda, ak ghaaghaambiichi nea geasisi mureeda dea mida damanda manda muudeanooda;",
